:: Help Company Daily Cycle [nobr] {"position":"700,4625"}
<p>When the last time slot of a day ends (after Late Night), a lot happens on its own.</p>

<h3>Every night</h3>
<ul>
	<li>Every <b>active project pays its daily revenue</b> into the company account, weekends too.</li>
	<li>The <a href="#" data-help="Help Company Finances">finance chart</a> gets a new entry.</li>
	<li>Every <a href="#" data-help="Help Company Devices">device</a> you own recharges by <b>15%</b>, and the early prototype by <<= $company.prototype.rechargePerDay || 10>>%.</li>
	<li>Every employee recovers morale: <b><<= setup.moraleRecovery()>></b> right now, from 4 to 12 depending on the company's Morale (see <a href="#" data-help="Help Company Stats">Company stats</a>).</li>
	<li>The company's <b>Efficiency</b> moves toward its target: up to <<= setup.companyStatTuning.efficiencyRise>> points up, or <<= setup.companyStatTuning.efficiencyFall>> down.</li>
	<li>Every client project that is overdue costs <b>1 Reputation</b>.</li>
	<li>$mom.callName and $sister.name recover <b>energy</b>. $sister.name recovers more than $mom.callName.</li>
	<li>The <a href="#" data-help="Help Company Tasks">tasks</a> are reset for the new day, ready to start again.</li>
</ul>

<h3>On Monday</h3>
<ul>
	<li>The <b>rent</b> is due. Bring it to the landlord before the evening, or he comes for it, see <a href="#" data-help="Help Company Finances">Finances</a>.</li>
	<li>The books of the old week are closed and a new one starts. The whole week of <a href="#" data-help="Help Company Employees">wages</a>, the utilities and your budget are paid out of the company account, and then the tax on the week that just ended (<a href="#" data-help="Help Company Finances">Finances</a>).</li>
	<li>In Stage 0, while $mom.callName still helps with the rent, her <b>$500</b> for the week arrives.</li>
	<li>The company's <b>Morale</b> settles <<= setup.companyStatTuning.moraleWeeklyDrift>> points back toward 50.</li>
</ul>

<h3>On weekends</h3>
<p>Nothing is scheduled and nobody works on projects. Only the nightly payments keep running.</p>
<div class="help-note">Time also passes whenever you spend an <a href="#" data-help="Help Company Actions">action</a>, and some actions can jump over a whole night.</div>
